---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Folio from '../components/Folio.astro';
import ScopeIcon from '../components/ScopeIcon.astro';
import WorkflowDiagram from '../components/WorkflowDiagram.astro';
import SafeguardScore from '../components/SafeguardScore.astro';
import { REPO_URL, repoFile, newIssue, url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="Contribute" description="How to contribute research, sources, verification and corrections to Academic Safeguard Europe." campaign>
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ label: 'Take Action', href: '/take-action/' }, { label: 'Contribute research' }]} kicker="Take action · Research">
    Contribute research
    <Fragment slot="lede">Coverage depends on people who read national law and university rules in the original language. No coding needed.</Fragment>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="sec--dense" aria-label="Ways to contribute">
    <div class="container">
      <Folio label="Ways to contribute" dense />
      <div class="contrib-grid">
        <article class="contrib-card">
          <h2 class="card-title">Add a source</h2>
          <p>Record an official law, statute or procedure once, with a stable ID.</p>
          <ul class="card-links" role="list">
            <li><a href={newIssue('source-submission.yml')}>Suggest a source</a></li>
            <li><a href={repoFile('docs/researcher-guide.md#1-record-a-source')}>Guide</a></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="contrib-card">
          <h2 class="card-title">Propose a country finding</h2>
          <p>Assess national rules against the rubric, citing the article.</p>
          <ul class="card-links" role="list">
            <li><a href={newIssue('research-contribution.yml')}>Open a proposal</a></li>
            <li><a href={repoFile('docs/researcher-guide.md#2-propose-a-finding')}>Guide</a></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="contrib-card">
          <h2 class="card-title">Add an institution</h2>
          <p>Start with a public statute, study regulation, ethics code or complaint procedure. A maintainer can use it to begin the profile.</p>
          <ul class="card-links" role="list">
            <li><a href={newIssue('source-submission.yml', '[Source] Institution — ')}>Suggest an institutional source on GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a href={repoFile('docs/researcher-guide.md#3-add-an-institution')}>Read the institution guide</a></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="contrib-card contrib-card--featured" id="verify">
          <p class="ss-mark ss-mark--sm featured-tag">Most needed</p>
          <h2 class="card-title">Verify a finding</h2>
          <p>Provisional findings need an independent second reviewer. Native speakers especially welcome.</p>
          <ul class="card-links" role="list">
            <li><a href={newIssue('research-contribution.yml', '[Verification] ')}>Start a verification on GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a href={repoFile('docs/researcher-guide.md#4-verify-a-finding')}>Read the verification guide</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small privacy-inline">The GitHub form is public. Use public documents only—no personal data, names, allegations or case details.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec--dense" aria-labelledby="contribute-start">
    <div class="container">
      <Folio label="How" dense />
      <h2 id="contribute-start">Contribute without editing code</h2>
      <ol class="step-list">
        <li>Choose the kind of contribution above and open its guide or structured GitHub form.</li>
        <li>Use a GitHub account or a pseudonymous account. If you are not comfortable editing files, open the relevant issue form and a maintainer can turn it into a pull request.</li>
        <li>Every proposal stays provisional until the evidence and method checks are complete.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="statement statement--provisional">
        <p><strong>GitHub submissions are public.</strong> Include only public documents—never personal data, names, allegations or case details. <a href={url('/take-action/#not-a-reporting-service')}>Contribute evidence, not accusations</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec--dense" aria-labelledby="workflow">
    <div class="container">
      <Folio label="Workflow" dense />
      <h2 id="workflow">Research workflow</h2>
      <WorkflowDiagram label="Research workflow" />
      <p class="caveat-line">
        <ScopeIcon name="evidence" size="1.15rem" />
        <span>A search result never becomes a public score directly.</span>
      </p>
      <details class="disclosure">
        <summary>What a research pull request contains</summary>
        <div class="prose">
          <ul>
            <li>jurisdiction, and institution if relevant;</li>
            <li>safeguard ID (S01–S12) and proposed result;</li>
            <li>evidence summary and exact source reference (article, section, page);</li>
            <li>rationale against the rubric;</li>
            <li>review date and methodology version;</li>
            <li>contributor identity or a pseudonymous contributor ID.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Automated validation runs on every pull request, and a PR cannot be merged until it passes.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec--dense" aria-labelledby="rules">
    <div class="container">
      <Folio label="Ground rules" dense />
      <h2 id="rules">Ground rules</h2>
      <ul class="rule-list">
        <li><span class="rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span>Never guess references, URLs, dates or quotes.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span><SafeguardScore result="NR" compact /> if not researched; <SafeguardScore result="?" compact /> if sources are unclear.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span>Two levels plausible? Choose the lower.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span>No personal data, names or allegations.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span>Disclose conflicts of interest.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={REPO_URL}>Go to the repository</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={repoFile('CONTRIBUTING.md')}>CONTRIBUTING.md →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
